{"prototypeToken":{"displayName":20,"displayBars":20,"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":true}},"height":1,"width":1,"name":"Bog Bomber","actorLink":false,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/tokens/bog-bomber.webp","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"negative":false,"priority":0},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/subjects/bog-bomber.webp"}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"depth":1},"name":"Bog Bomber","type":"npc","effects":[],"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":215,"temp":0,"max":215,"details":""},"ac":{"value":30,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":25,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"swim","value":25}],"details":"swamp surge"},"immunities":[{"type":"fire","exceptions":[]},{"type":"paralyzed","exceptions":[]},{"type":"sleep","exceptions":[]}],"weaknesses":[{"type":"cold","value":10,"exceptions":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":[],"details":""},"level":{"value":10},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Bog bombers are huge creatures that resemble red bullfrogs with draconic features. They are a hybrid species, a cross between a flame drake and a giant frog. Boggards found a way to breed these monsters together, which either results in a nest of bog bombers or dozens of dead boggards.</p>\n<p>Boggards use bog bombers to defend and expand their territory. They lure these monsters with juicy giant dragon flies. However, there are times when these delicious meals go unnoticed and a bog bomber escapes, looking for bigger prey. That is why it's possible to see feral bog bombers in the wild.</p>\n<p>The reason boggards go to such great lengths to produce bog bombers is that they make formidable allies, especially in battle. Bog bombers have the ability to spit huge balls of fire at their prey. In addition, they can jump and sprint incredible distances, and they have the ability to breathe both fire and water.</p>\n<p>Bog bombers tend to consume their prey by lashing out with their sticky, fiery tongues, pulling their prey toward their gaping giant maws. Once within the gullet, the bog bomber spits their prey out in a fireball and then consumes the exploded remains.</p>\n<p>If boggards continue to breed such monstrosities, they might start to conquer lands outside their home swamps, with bog bombers leading the charge.</p>\n<h2>Fatal Attraction</h2>\n<p>Bog bombers are instinctively attracted to other fiery creatures. Boggards must be careful to keep them away from fire elementals lest they abandon their masters for shinier, fierier ones, and villages near boggard territories maintain straw effigies they can ignite to distract them. Red dragons are the ultimate attraction for these pyromaniacs, but sadly, the dragons do not return their affection. A red dragon may tolerate the presence of bog bombers for a little while if it is planning to attack a city, at which time it picks them up to drop from the sky.</p>\n<h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2>\n<p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 125/275/500 gp</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning, piercing), armor (light, medium, heavy), perception item, skill items (Acrobatics, Athletics, Intimidation, Stealth)</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, constitution, elongating, energy resistant (fire, positive), fire, strength, wild</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Strange and Unusual","authors":"Marty Martinez","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"creatureType":""},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":7},"dex":{"mod":3},"con":{"mod":6},"int":{"mod":-3},"wis":{"mod":5},"cha":{"mod":-1}},"perception":{"details":"smoke vision","mod":16,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"},{"type":"scent","acuity":"imprecise","range":20}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":22,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":17,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":17,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":22},"athletics":{"base":19,"special":[{"label":"20 to High Jump or Long Jump","base":20,"predicate":[{"or":["action:high-jump","action:long-jump"]}]}]},"intimidation":{"base":19},"stealth":{"base":22}},"traits":{"value":["amphibious","dragon","fire"],"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"huge"}}},"img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/Portraits/bog-bomber.webp","items":[{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Darkvision","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Darkvision]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"darkvision","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.0.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687201836787,"modifiedTime":1687201836787,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.qCCLZhnp2HhP3Ex6","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"3LhxLImSvGKMPGG0"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Scent (Imprecise) 20 feet","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Scent]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"scent","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.0.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687201840807,"modifiedTime":1687201852748,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.rqfnQ5VHT5hxm25r","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"1w99jSekrFGhiose"},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Smoke Vision","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Smoke doesn’t impair a bog bomber’s vision; it ignores @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealement} from smoke.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"3LRg7lOVs8bCQbzi","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.0.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687202039490,"modifiedTime":1687202068349,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Frogsplosion","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>When a bog bomber is reduced to 0 Hit Points, it explodes in a @Template[type:burst|distance:20] at its center, dealing @Damage[8d6[fire]] damage (@Check[type:reflex|dc:27|basic:true] save). If creatures are inside the bog bomber when it explodes take an additional [[/r 2d6[fire]]] damage and a –2 circumstance penalty on their Reflex save to avoid all burst damage.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":true,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"c88SaLTuil83Ai7S","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687202155330,"modifiedTime":1691261014368,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Fireball Breath","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The bog bomber expels a ball of flame to a range of 180 feet that explodes in a @Template[type:burst|distance:20]. Creatures in the burst take @Damage[9d6[fire]] damage (@Check[type:reflex|dc:27|basic:true] save). If there are creatures swallowed by the bog bomber and the bog bomber uses its fireball breath, the damage of the fire ball increases by an additional 1d6 fire damage per creature, to a maximum of [[/r 12d6[fire]]]{12d6} if it swallowed three or more creatures. The bog bomber can't use Fireball Breath again for [[/br 1d4 #Fireball Breath Recharge]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>\n<p>[[/r 10d6[fire]]]</p>\n<p>[[/r 11d6[fire]]]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["arcane","fire"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"dQCoayncYPtlt9wM","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687202216188,"modifiedTime":1691261014385,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Flame Tongue Grab","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A creature hit by the bog bomber's tongue becomes @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Grabbed]{Grabbed} by the bog bomber and takes [[/r 2d6[persistent,fire]]] damage. Unlike normal for the grabbed condition, though, the creature isn't @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Immobilized]{Immobilized}; instead, it can't move farther away from the bog bomber. A creature can sever the tongue with a Strike against AC 25 that deals at least 20 slashing damage. This deals no damage to the bog bomber, but prevents it from using its tongue Strike until its tongue regrows, which takes a day.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["fire"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"iRQaRbZ9z7WeNMsT","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.0.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687202382213,"modifiedTime":1687202420400,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Jaws","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"4MBwRbsElGB3hY4m":{"damage":"2d12+13","damageType":"piercing","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":23},"attackEffects":{"value":["grab"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"effects":[],"_id":"dzquWHp0G12hhGUD","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.0.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687202426751,"modifiedTime":1687202458874,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Tongue","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["fire","reach-30"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"6SYad8yRGMbUenOQ":{"damage":"2d6+10","damageType":"fire","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":23},"attackEffects":{"value":["fl